Hi,

I am having an issue with converting 6-column gtf to 12-column BED that is required MethylKit. I have looked at the answers provided within this group and also on Biostars but they have not worked.

I am getting the following error when reading in the annotation file:
gene.fusarium.obj=readTranscriptFeatures("Fusarium_graminearum.RR.31.bed")

error:

Reading the table...
Calculating intron coordinates...
Error in rep(1:nrow(ref), ref[, 10]) : invalid 'times' argument
In addition: Warning message:
In `[.data.frame`(ref, rep(1:nrow(ref), ref[, 10]), ) :
  NAs introduced by coercion

the BED file was created from the gtf file downloaded from Ensembl Fungi and converted using:
awk '{ if ($0 ~ "transcript_id") print $0; else print $0" transcript_id \"\";"; }' Fusarium_graminearum.RR.31.gtf | gtf2bed - > Fusarium_graminearum.RR.31.bed

Any help is much appreciated

