I just wanted to put the solution I found for anyone with similar issue:

I used UCSC tool gtfToGenePred and used the output as input of genePredToBed.

Download links:
gtfToGenePred http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/admin/exe/linux.x86_64/gtfToGenePred
genePredToBed http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/admin/exe/linux.x86_64/genePredToBed

Hope this helps others.

