Hi Nuria,

Pass a list instead of a vector in the argument "location":
location = list("sample1_CpG.txt", "sample2_CpG.txt", "sample3_CpG.txt")

NB: About lists and vectors for arguments in methylKit, note that the function methylKit:::readMethylBaseDB requires a vector and not a list for the argument sample.ids while all other functions I tested so far with a sample.ids argument require a list.

Best
Johan

