Hi Núria,

from the error message and your code I guess that you missed to add the list of sample.ids.

And Johan is right, the locations should also be passed as list:

samples_CG = methRead(location = list("sample1_CpG.txt", "sample2_CpG.txt", "sample3_CpG.txt"),
                      sample.id <http://sample.id> = list("sample1", "sample2", "sample3"),

                      assembly = "tair9",
                      dbtype = "tabix",
                      pipeline = "bismark",
                      context = "CpG",
                      resolution = "base",
                      dbdir = getwd(),
                      mincov = 3 )

Best,
Alex

